<title>CHINA: Shanghai Wai Gaoqiao net falls 9.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Wai Gaoqiao net falls 9.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated)</p>
<p> Turnover	 307.434	vs	   314.111</p>
<p> Net profit	57.455	vs	   63.754</p>
<p> Net asset per share	1.86 yuan   vs   1.82 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share     0.0933 yuan   vs   0.1035 yuan</p>
<p>Note: Shanghai Waigaoqiao Free Trade Zone Development Co Ltd . Figures are unaudited.</p>
</text>
